I am in my quiet room now.
I put my bag on the bed.
I sit on the chair.
I open my laptop.
It is Thursday night here.
In Mexico, it is morning time.
I make a video call home.
My mother's picture appears on the computer.
She answers the video call.
There is a beautiful smile on her face.
She says, "Hello Maya!"
I greet her with respect.
I say, "Greetings, mother."
"How are you?"
Mother says, "I am well, daughter."
"What did you do today?"
I say, "Today was a very good day."
"I played badminton with friends."
"I also did a lot of work at the office."
I look at her happy face.
